<title>SWITZERLAND: Forbo sets conveyor belt venture in China.</title>
<headline>Forbo sets conveyor belt venture in China.</headline>
<dateline>EGLISAU, Switzerland 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forbo Holding AG said it had signed a joint venture agreement to set up a company in China to manufacture and distribute light conveyor belts and transmission belts.</p>
<p>&quot;Forbo will hold -- through its German subsidiary Siegling GmbH in Hanover -- 80 percent of the share capital of $6 million, while 20 percent will be held by Shenyang General Rubber Belt Factory in Shenyang,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The venture will set up its production facilities this year and expects to start production in 1998, it said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
